/**
 * Git does not track empty directories. If `src` has no tracked files,
 * it will not appear in the repository history or on GitHub.
 * 
 * To keep the directory, add a placeholder file like `.gitkeep` (or any file),
 * then commit and push. This ensures `src` is tracked even if currently empty.
 */
# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

